<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="6">

  <DocumentRef DateTime="20250719T225100" id="311bf653-30ed-4d65-a49b-1d9bc7012bab">
    <XRef DateTime="20250719T224917" id="326d3bbb-277d-4966-b8b4-fc0c38660087"/>
  </DocumentRef>

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="97f7e936-f687-4e02-a244-b8207704c28d">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DAWN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DAWN &amp; YORO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="YORO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Louisiana Woods - Night (2017)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7ec7d420-048c-403d-83d8-e4bf1f83af4e">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Nothing...</Text>
      <Text> Then we hear the diverse sounds of the </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">marsh</Text>
      <Text>: croaks and chirps.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a60d92c8-100e-488a-94da-ffed853951ae">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">A floating quote appears in glowing, handwritten script:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8dd322fd-ff5a-4a4a-8bf7-4b14b6f93140">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">“</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">gân</Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps"> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">muc</Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps"> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">thì</Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps"> den, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">gân</Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps"> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">dèn</Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps"> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">thì</Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps"> sang.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bcd82f10-dbb3-4f84-9df5-e74efa27e5c7">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Subtitle: close to ink then black, near by light then bright.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="535d72d6-298e-402c-8e01-6fbf25522d20">
      <Text>An orb of yellow light known as a </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">fifollet</Text>
      <Text> zips past. It snuffs the words out like a candle wick.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ffdc8661-9fe0-4c2c-8c12-5376b5adb24d">
      <Text>In the distance, two teenagers are hardly visible in the brush. Dawn Chu (16), an emo-clad force of nature, watches. Beside her, Yoro Sakho (16) .</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="60bf2678-8e7c-45c5-92a9-f602d0b48b4c">
      <Text>DaWN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e1770f64-c99c-415d-afb3-cbb25316e10e">
      <Text>Well, I’ll be damned.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="66f58fb1-661f-4ad0-bbcf-8759aefcb025">
      <Text>Yoro</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="aba4d878-5038-415b-ab8e-a7a26984e5d9">
      <Text>From research, that thing should double back...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="80cd8029-db22-4723-9191-989b059b4983">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Dawn’s POV</Text>
      <Text>: She </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">strikes</Text>
      <Text> a match inches from Yoro’s face.. The light illuminates a startled Senegalese Louisianan boy, YORO SAKHO (16). He flinches, squinting at the flame.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d0805e2e-afc9-4390-8cd7-33c8f5bebd4c">
      <Text>Yoro</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="4ac60e42-0ce4-494c-a13d-86507fe89d7b">
      <Text>(in French; subtitled)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0d5cdbe2-52f9-4f33-ae6e-60e0501742a2">
      <Text Style="Italic">Blind me before I see the damn thing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a6730c7b-1436-4822-9dae-c67115233c26">
      <Text>DawN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="22182f26-d4be-4291-910d-c80cfb7fdf6f">
      <Text>Lighten up cause ya won’t catch up!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d9eb3e77-0431-4491-8476-fbd6d5163086">
      <Text>Dawn </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">bolts</Text>
      <Text>. Her boots slap against the mud as she chases the glow. Yoro shakes off the spots in his eyes and charges after her, his sneakers skidding on exposed roots.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0a97bd2d-a4e5-4174-bc36-867e02db9e73">
      <Text>He runs past her and lunges and his fingers close around the glow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="27c0166c-3488-4b86-bcbd-bf2f8865c02a">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crack</Text>
      <Text>. Yoro’s foot sinks into a hole. He hits the mud face-first, his hands flying open.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="678c7079-3d26-44d9-a08e-247238aea1fb">
      <Text>The fifollet shoots out of his grip and dances mockingly over his head before zipping toward the horizon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="441f9baf-bd3a-422c-94b9-eae67e58da21">
      <Text>Yoro reaches out, his hand caked in mud, as the orb vanishes into the first blinding rays of the </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">sunrise</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1a20c304-388a-4ceb-90b7-1207050cdc87">
      <Text>Dawn skids to a halt and pulls him up by his collar.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="04e0a98d-00df-4bf0-b2d5-4806ea2e7a7f">
      <Text>DawN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d3a74142-d277-4484-97fe-705064794937">
      <Text>Classic Yoro. Ya finally felt the sun and immediately tripped over the Earth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a018224d-a7e8-4aed-a8f3-b19a4924aca4">
      <Text>Dawn uses a thumb to smear mud off his forehead. Yoro ignores the gesture, staring at the sky.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="05b35c42-98bb-41da-a384-5a4f81a95e41">
      <Text>YorO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2e40e324-2e05-43b3-89a6-fcf93f06ffc9">
      <Text>Today, we’re not feeling the sun cause it’s...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cc3ed44f-79ac-4659-9294-cb18bfd378db">
      <Text>Dawn &amp; Yoro</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="41ebb3ec-ce6a-4e70-8aa1-9e44a3b2be1d">
      <Text>...the eclipse.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="928c6eae-8fad-4474-b722-e7ab72d76da0">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Sakho-Chu Duplex - Morning</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="65915cf6-600b-4603-a402-e4ba7eb092b9">
      <Text>The duplex is two shotgun houses, painted a sea-foam color. On the Sakho north side, the porch is cluttered with </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">futbols</Text>
      <Text> and a broken lawnmower. The Chu south side has wind chimes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c08d0940-50f9-4d32-bbde-f78db629c745">
      <Text>Yoro, looking like he lost a wrestling match with a swamp, creeps towards the Sakho porch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2317ad41-958a-4f3c-a875-ef4a7e909171">
      <SceneProperties Length="2" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SALL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SAVANNA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="YORO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Sakho Home - ContinUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f1bba02b-a3d5-4614-84f1-2925c16fc826">
      <Text>Yoro enters and quietly closes the door. He walks around the home with his shoes on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8ef56c48-e2c3-49b8-966e-2b2465fb8ac2">
      <Text>SaVANNA (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="0fe5dbca-fc3c-4374-88ee-164b918a7421">
      <Text>(Disgruntled voice)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="50937423-62e0-4753-91b3-b2c74c98c906">
      <Text>Walking in your shoes would make the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Chus</Text>
      <Text>’ head go boom!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b5d272dc-950a-4276-8cfb-b2aad0a89bc1">
      <Text>Yoro freezes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4ceee8b9-f755-4a69-9a9c-f8084cf4e373">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Savanna Sakho</Text>
      <Text> (12) sits at the dining table, holding </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Baker G</Text>
      <Text>, a hulking wrestling action figure with a championship belt. She moves the figure’s arm as if he’s pointing at Yoro.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="86c97b15-1bf7-437d-a6c9-e3fffaba3748">
      <Text>Yoro</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5d858cde-d8f2-4c83-b480-f662b0d7a6ea">
      <Text>Savanna. It’s six in the morning.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a01f20b5-4b2f-442a-9369-f98c71bf9d0b">
      <Text>SAVANNA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="edc107d6-2c69-4899-bfae-5528d6d81ad7">
      <Text>(Normal voice)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fb6a33b3-be1d-4512-a4d5-caa4c3aeb4eb">
      <Text>Baker G had a nightmare about the folding chair monster. Also, he says you smell like failure... and swamp rot?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e2f354db-70d2-4de9-a51c-ba6aa1ec811e">
      <Text>YORO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="72894fd9-0df8-4f20-9707-6fd9dc7957c4">
      <Text>I was out... calculating the eclipse.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5d45e09c-4a23-4e48-9634-2baf474963fd">
      <Text>SAVANNA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="17705d0b-8355-47c4-8ad7-6632f444fef2">
      <Text>I guess you can’t calculate gravity before you fell in mud, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">couillon</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="742357c4-9abd-4ff3-a957-ed94fc0b092a">
      <Text>Savanna circles Yoro like a shark.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="97fd3514-f1d5-4611-857c-65fce414a625">
      <Text>SAVANNA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cb1c7c87-fe90-4590-9393-e89db3c1ba07">
      <Text>Does Papa know you snuck out to play with Dawn again?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a56bc367-f3d7-403d-b1ca-f91d9bcb2408">
      <Text>Yoro</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4ec3fa62-c3dd-44e6-a349-5eac91d67b6d">
      <Text>No better time than sunrise.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="112cb64e-00d3-41e1-b53e-b9d3b5ac6dcb">
      <Text>SaVANNA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9ca36192-7ee2-4b39-9972-93c4564bb7ed">
      <Text>Not what I mean. You ain’t chasing sunrise...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="24114555-925f-4d98-8481-cf53716b7727">
      <Text>(as Baker G)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="36daf7b8-e541-4122-bcf3-eb1d2fa151cd">
      <Text>Ya chasing fireflies!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6dab69b4-5c8a-4fc4-9f41-95981d97c504">
      <Text>Yoro</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="466aa118-db56-41e0-8554-b0ab52e78866">
      <Text>Nonsense!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d8cf8ad4-2f28-40c9-b151-36e2df669628">
      <Text>SaVANNA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bf41ce69-17ac-4e93-80a0-b15f7ed48207">
      <Text>I’ve seen your sketches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a23ef31f-b359-452e-a946-6fbf06758e32">
      <Text>Yoro</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6e7c634e-c944-4f87-9d15-a74fa6314056">
      <Text>Get </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">outta</Text>
      <Text> my room!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e7a0a830-626c-493e-854d-2ae9281060e4">
      <Text>Inside the kitchen, the </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">thud</Text>
      <Text> of a coffee pot hitting a counter echoes. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">Sall</Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps"> Sakho</Text>
      <Text> (37) is awake.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bad39165-4456-4b1d-b6c4-9e3c7dd9a0eb">
      <Text>Yoro</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="8f4a34c8-2cb5-4c2a-852a-b9eae28cb3cf">
      <Text>(Hissing)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="93b78ec0-a2a0-4cd5-a3ee-cf393a765d1a">
      <Text>Savanna, don't. I’ll give you my PlayStation for a week.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="964a46e8-2bca-4be9-9e17-b7e5edd5717d">
      <Text>SavANNA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37c0c660-d1ad-4058-9642-1a1344a002d7">
      <Text>Two weeks. And you have to let Baker G use your laptop to watch Wrestle-Mania.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2f5ed5a3-bd4a-4d74-b39b-90e385ada959">
      <Text>Yoro</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6b2a4b4d-177b-43db-b68a-83130967e14f">
      <Text>Fine!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="45801d0a-75e6-45b1-917a-b4826a87f4f1">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sall</Text>
      <Text> Sakho enters, with a sharp gaze. He’s wearing an old Geaux Tigers hoodie. He looks at Yoro’s mud-caked clothes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a8cff12d-d309-49c6-9ab3-45af5b58fa30">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sall</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b6be5247-d243-4a30-a262-18c460787589">
      <Text>Yoro. Why are you wearing the marsh on your face?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="02f15038-7660-464b-b996-ff3b91f8358d">
      <Text>Savanna</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a7803278-309f-4b4a-9d0c-fcae22786d85">
      <Text>He and Baker G were mudwrestling. Of course, Baker G won.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e0f36fc6-4599-4d20-b503-f36f824479cb">
      <Text>She gives Yoro a “you owe me” look.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dec28bb7-7bd3-4fa4-8bf0-669f4d03bd67">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sall</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="4eacd9d8-09ce-418d-9138-16e0b2e9862a">
      <Text>(Sighs)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4057c7b9-7d00-4799-889d-f272b0210218">
      <Text>Gee... Go wash. We leave for the clearing in an hour. The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Grenos</Text>
      <Text> are already being... the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Grenos</Text>
      <Text>. I don't need you looking like a swamp creature when we're trying to stay on Fanny’s good side.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="980f8dfb-a10f-4ce1-a442-df68b0870c67">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sall</Text>
      <Text> returns to his room. Yoro exhales, but Savanna lingers. She holds Baker G up to Yoro’s ear.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4b6c8184-e384-4e27-9a7b-005a0c2c64b7">
      <Text>SAVANNA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="03d9f8f5-b284-4fa5-9c20-d217a31f0ce5">
      <Text>(as Baker G)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c07f7647-4bb3-449e-8c9e-9251550f6868">
      <Text>The debt is recorded. Don't make me come collect.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="35619e53-5b92-4767-945c-e123b9d7d196">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="4" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DAWN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="EMMETT">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Chu Porch - Same Time</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0b9b0f1b-0397-46ab-8e24-58b28d34f397">
      <Text>Dawn sits, hunched over her notebook, scribbling dollar signs and lyrics. The screen door </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">creaks</Text>
      <Text> open.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="721dfd42-b6bd-4458-a187-3f118668e6af">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Emmett Chu</Text>
      <Text> (12) steps out. He wears a bathrobe and got on some slippers, carrying a bowl of Marshmallow </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Matey</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="df9735e8-0eb0-4c96-ac70-6cb9084e8eb2">
      <Text>Dawn</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1ba33ef1-e21e-40ff-abb2-71468b359ecd">
      <Text>Ya look like you’re waiting for a spa treatment that’s never coming.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5b788cb2-0d86-4433-8706-f5a369c3a31a">
      <Text>EMMETT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c820b032-b0ef-4967-9c49-a7307c2fa694">
      <Text>I’m a monk, Dawn! I saw this guy on YouTube who said if you don't speak during a celestial event, your brain, like, unlocks. I’m doing a vow of silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e83a9b6a-1be8-4395-bce1-5b0b14b43395">
      <Text>DAWN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="62ada432-3050-4557-866f-0db010e53788">
      <Text>You’re literally talking right now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7d73c2ea-29f8-4528-9706-0df8c82eb619">
      <Text>EMMETT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ee83862d-aece-4814-a87b-d6a44f26c3e1">
      <Text>Wait, no- I mean, after I finish my cereal! I’m in the pre-vow phase. It’s for my spiritual alignment.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bcc6f3d1-31c4-416b-9892-25790d617e8c">
      <Text>DAWN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="06b28593-c088-4b4d-bde1-e87415d354a7">
      <Text>That robe? Bailey is gonna have a field day.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="914166b8-5c61-4244-a18e-2ddb3c3003cc">
      <Text>Emmett shoves a spoonful of marshmallows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ed5857ae-2da0-477b-937a-be669ce02a1a">
      <Text>EMMETT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ce66848d-50c0-4cb0-b573-4b1b32a3b1d1">
      <Text>Bailey’s just a hater. Besides, if I don't talk, he can’t make fun of what I say.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a1281297-2579-48aa-8361-3220c8d6f632">
      <Text>DAWN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="d7d02bd2-b22f-4539-8a37-588701854c11">
      <Text>(Closing her book)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="83318792-242b-4436-8028-8e15ca74f533">
      <Text>Not making fun of what you’re saying. Your sayings are just a load of garbage. You’ll be a target. You’re gonna be the only kid looking like a giant marshmallow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b89c0c44-69f9-440f-8524-19fab2484c32">
      <Text>EMMETT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c87dd785-735c-49e9-95be-705bd915427a">
      <Text>It’s comfortable! And it’s got deep pockets for my eclipse glasses.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f02ed54f-b0fe-492c-802c-ffc0b5b46367">
      <Text>He tries to strike a </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">zen</Text>
      <Text> pose but trips over the hem of the robe, nearly spilling his cereal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ad670cfc-2b73-4404-8c5f-1c6c42615184">
      <Text>DAWN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1e588c44-58cf-4439-99c5-394c1c1566ca">
      <Text>Nice. Very enlightened. The ground really felt your presence there.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fabf6030-590a-41e1-8704-c0973ee0a733">
      <Text>EMMETT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c18c1d72-60dd-4909-9086-3902a18496f0">
      <Text>Meant to do that. It was a... grounding exercise.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="082431c8-ce0b-45da-9071-c5fc796ef657">
      <Text>DawN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37a1fa45-4179-4c63-8d3d-d40006321e55">
      <Text>Come on. Let’s head to Uncle Minh before he grounds us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="adcf12fe-87b6-4fd0-bcc4-fbe046d626aa">
      <Text>Dawn helps Emmett up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="0bf0dfb1-d4a2-4746-b28b-3e15456ebe26">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="5" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SALL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SAVANNA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="YORO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. YORO’S BEDROOM - LatER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a959a6fb-52c5-46c4-8c98-9ff70c9f1f75">
      <Text>The room is a cramped museum. Tacked to the walls are blurry </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">polaroids</Text>
      <Text> of marshes and hand-drawn frantic red circles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="13e864e0-0c97-4ec7-8c99-dec23e4a17da">
      <Text>Yoro enters in a towel, coming in from a shower. He stares at a framed photograph on his desk: a smiling woman, holding a much younger Yoro. She’s wearing a field jacket and holding a vintage compass.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d47be335-dd2c-4b39-97d8-b4823ad9b91b">
      <Text>YORO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8c966541-2a01-4fcb-90d9-7dcaf7db34a7">
      <Text>Light is a constant. Truth is a constant. You didn't just walk into the trees and “dissolve,” </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Italic">Maman</Text>
      <Text>. That ain’t how matter works.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5443d760-8028-4e9e-93af-ed28a4038882">
      <Text>He pulls a worn, leather-bound journal from a hidden drawer. The first page is dated "The Night of the 2008 Surge." Underneath, a child’s shaky handwriting describes a "yellow light that led the way."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a9394d2e-cf29-46d3-81a3-eebcf1fb14f1">
      <Text>He traces the sketch of a </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">fifollet</Text>
      <Text> he drew when he was six. Every capture attempt since then—the jars, the light-meters, the math—isn't for a science fair. It’s for a breadcrumb trail.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="002ed95c-e3e1-4640-8bf1-5a4e82f3b0e2">
      <Text>YORO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e85a58e4-87c8-4e75-9f2c-2f3322317f9f">
      <Text>Papa says you got lost in the rain. Savanna says you’re a star now. But the fireflies... they’re the only ones who were there that night.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="717df093-133b-43f1-94a6-572068cf88c9">
      <Text>He grabs a fresh mason jar, his grip tightening.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c291841d-6c8a-4ede-b86e-42defc49c6f4">
      <Text>YORO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="de7d5028-2584-46c9-80d3-14ce8327dcc5">
      <Text>If I catch one, I can ask where the “lost” go.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c840b6f6-4bca-4b56-b64b-f4ebdd053ef8">
      <Text>A thud against the wall—the shared duplex boundary—jolts him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f6402613-ce30-4e2d-b184-bcd477ec44f2">
      <Text>SAVANNA (O.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e200c881-9a34-4131-8c23-ac7af9872ebc">
      <Text>Bruh! Baker G says we’re gonna miss the Extinction Event!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1ebbc3d1-be69-4781-a30b-f8ea627ac03e">
      <Text>YORO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d3303998-cc20-4f3c-bbcc-136eab85ba63">
      <Text>You put the stink in extinction!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="024563eb-eff0-4230-95dc-8749f656d03f">
      <Text>SaVANNA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cb386cc1-01f2-45f6-b0a8-806b20fc1f86">
      <Text>Dad! Yoro says I stink!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f5e2d970-047f-43b2-ad31-a7aecd3212d7">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sall</Text>
      <Text> (O.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1586312c-66bf-44f0-987d-09121506fd2e">
      <Text>Yoro...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0c92341d-2ff0-4a5e-b8dd-877242a0a84d">
      <Text>Yoro goes to exits, pauses at the door, glancing one last time at the compass in the photo.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5a60cdea-fbee-471f-8f7d-316aebf556cb">
      <Text>YORO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b86dae2b-3b9b-4891-a701-eb4b5d03fc14">
      <Text>I didn’t say she stinks. I said she should go-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f1dff5a2-f346-4ee1-a8d7-20dd6e9bc094">
      <Text>Yoro leaves the room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="52d17c73-59c3-42b0-a297-189f9bea33d8">
      <SceneProperties Length="4 3/8" Page="6" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BAILEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DAWN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="FANNY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MINH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SALL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SAVANNA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="YORO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Clearing - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="98bee826-9927-40f4-9d32-aa2129c7af7c">
      <Text>The clearing is a patch of grass surrounded by cypress trees.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a1835e1f-f390-4395-959a-31d970224251">
      <Text>A telescope sits on a tripod. Minh Chu (37) is adjusting the lens. He wears a space shirt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ba7b37e4-023c-48d2-9b8c-f22788566132">
      <Text>Beside him, Emmett (12) wears a bathrobe and stares intensely at a blade of grass.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2b5e3577-5f47-4724-b176-2168e1144e1e">
      <Text>Dawn sits on the tailgate of a beat-up truck, sketching in a black notebook.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="10039aaa-07e1-485f-be53-f31ec4e2e95f">
      <Text>MINH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="5dd776d5-10f1-40cd-a4aa-bfc495cb9663">
      <Text>(to the telescope)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="baa4aba0-55bc-477e-bbcb-4c43197d6427">
      <Text>Don’t be shy, baby. Show me the corona. I’ve waited since the ‘91 eclipse for this. I was eleven. I cried. I won’t cry today.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e8a70e57-a9f4-4777-8b60-ae895e01f37f">
      <Text>DAWN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d76d835d-3993-4283-a3c4-65c495b10348">
      <Text>You’re crying a little bit right now, Uncle Minh.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="317ac6d5-0681-43e4-b8b3-4c2bd36b584d">
      <Text>MINH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="39d12c24-657c-4a59-a31b-6022f949a9fc">
      <Text>(Wiping a tear)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ae67c2a8-aee1-4657-bce7-83b51e0169b2">
      <Text>All allergies to mediocrity.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="de579d97-67b3-4fc4-8d6c-14d551959a85">
      <Text>The Sakho’s sedan rumbles into the clearing. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sall</Text>
      <Text>, Yoro, and Savanna, who is clutching Baker G, pile out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f078d696-60c8-4361-8b44-9601eb2d5d8a">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sall</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="685b76ea-06ba-4dc5-9e1d-6fc3ee1d93fc">
      <Text>I see you brought the big guns, Minh. Expecting to see God, or just my property line?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ff5fcce8-1b6b-4a22-bcb2-e7d890777a2a">
      <Text>MINH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="c63764d0-809f-4c74-bd15-6dceb818fcbc">
      <Text>(Smirks)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ab31be9e-a7e6-4354-99ed-f9106ee34ad3">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sall</Text>
      <Text>. I see you brought your children. Brave, considering Yoro looks like he was dragged behind a boat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="260b173f-0429-4af7-8eee-d4810ec6369c">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sall</Text>
      <Text> looks at Yoro, then back to Minh. He holds up a cooler.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ab6526f7-1f49-4595-a41f-ca355d0c1119">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">SALL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e9141cdc-25aa-4c14-9f0d-fd8fccc8c68c">
      <Text>I brought Jollof. And some boudin from the shop.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9373bb6d-af42-4185-964a-0e9d9386fd85">
      <Text>MINH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="d45116b8-0504-4901-8415-e0f385e1c2bf">
      <Text>(Softening)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3fa6432b-594d-45a9-98cd-277ca64d9858">
      <Text>I have spring rolls. And a very expensive solar filter. Sit. But don’t touch the tripod or I will deport myself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="88fd98f9-8200-401e-b9af-eed69df2048e">
      <Text>Yoro walks over to Dawn. He’s wearing a clean shirt but still looks frazzled.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5ebf6ef9-ff0d-4e5f-b4ea-c66c41ce631e">
      <Text>YORO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3821c9ed-1da8-4f76-b269-0aec39330ba8">
      <Text>Found a spot for the camera?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f804558f-cadb-4b2f-973b-6db465dc6382">
      <Text>DAWN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="68e4aea2-66cc-4b57-9c9d-0733f9fee3f9">
      <Text>The universe is a void, Yoro. Why record its blinking eye?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b08027cf-ca0e-41d4-a402-bd4a003bd7bc">
      <Text>YORO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="52e6b95f-a9e3-4eb2-9f98-ff6abd80730f">
      <Text>Because it only blinks once every few decades?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2ab2459e-d356-446b-ac96-033dba0d578c">
      <Text>DAWN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="5d4c7114-df3a-4264-a492-5b235a8e96fb">
      <Text>(Closing her book)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6d6f5c48-717d-4159-847f-94b3bd69439e">
      <Text>Terrible advice: You should have stayed in the mud. The light is going to be disappointing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="83874c9a-a514-43b9-9630-e0c51c68f406">
      <Text>Suddenly, a LOUD CRUNCH of tires on gravel. A pristine white SUV pulls up. BAILEY </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">GRENOS</Text>
      <Text> (13) leans out the window, wearing $200 sunglasses.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2f1fde79-dac7-4f46-aa73-159b7f9d1e5d">
      <Text>BAILEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="780ea6c4-4cd5-4a88-8a96-152d772a33b5">
      <Text>Hey, look! It’s the Duplex Circus!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6e2f9fe8-3352-4d4d-a53b-8be9c8629506">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Fanny </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">Grenos</Text>
      <Text> (66) climbs out of the driver's seat. She’s dressed in hunting camo but wears a string of real pearls. She holds a walking stick like a scepter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cb61af92-6934-488d-a01e-ded0b22f9bd4">
      <Text>FANNY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b9a7b480-00fe-412f-9e50-83dd81e82532">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sall</Text>
      <Text>. Minh. I see you’ve made yourselves comfortable on my family’s dirt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="61607706-43c4-40b1-8b41-cc1d35aaa932">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">SALL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4e566a73-c304-4f23-8ab2-d357e4a9d249">
      <Text>Fanny. You said the clearing was open for the neighborhood.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d33d3217-fa96-4a1e-a7bd-123a206d102b">
      <Text>FANNY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a49b03f1-7830-4042-8e58-201b3dcf0a80">
      <Text>It is. But the neighborhood usually pays its rent on the first, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sall</Text>
      <Text>. Not the fifth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="df43b30d-47b6-4227-a618-f420948f78f0">
      <Text>She scans the ground, her eyes lingering on the woods where the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">fifollet</Text>
      <Text> vanished earlier.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a0fada04-a058-4df9-8a8b-b7a4b3a015fb">
      <Text>FANNY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d18c9690-f02d-41b7-8ce6-c32f83dc1a11">
      <Text>Be careful where you kids play. There’s things in these woods that don't belong to you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a60fc449-00fc-43a3-9223-f3a21de1b2c4">
      <Text>Bailey jumps out and struts over to Emmett.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="440e7c8d-4b61-48e1-8d54-6d70a16dab11">
      <Text>BAILEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e6d312a0-4e43-47b4-8161-b71a7fd25b8c">
      <Text>Hey, Monk-boy. Nice bathrobe. Did your mom give it to you before she left?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a21c753c-580b-41a2-9f2d-cf564eee5f52">
      <Text>Emmett doesn't break character, but his lip quivers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="456a759d-9b9d-4ea7-8153-4aa3460969a1">
      <Text>SAVANNA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="271df876-80d4-4ea4-9224-971b923c7e53">
      <Text>Hey, Bailey. Baker G says your breath smells like wet dog and entitlement.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7845eb3b-617e-4150-804a-6c254ab3a734">
      <Text>BAILEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e326894a-5bcd-409a-87db-425956c17acb">
      <Text>Shut up, squirt. Or what?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9de38f7d-88db-4345-b951-f69104b09be4">
      <Text>The sky </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">dims</Text>
      <Text>. The birds stop chirping. A strange, silvery twilight washes over the trees.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1868701c-6166-4216-9db2-5df7ea4e4394">
      <Text>YORO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c8a7a0bb-2bae-49db-bf40-483e5554834f">
      <Text>It’s happening.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5d0e0edf-958d-4fca-9d76-449b3f47cab7">
      <Text>Yoro looks through his binoculars. In the reflection of the glass, we see the moon's shadow taking a bite out of the sun.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5f222f39-062b-41d3-ab3d-31a7b022d5a5">
      <Text>Nearby, in the thick brush, a yellow glow pulses. It ain’t no nighttime </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">fifolet</Text>
      <Text>. It’s a </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">daytime </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">fifolet</Text>
      <Text>. And she’s watching them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3f3887b3-5ec2-4cb5-ac2d-021704a1c97a">
      <Text>The temperature drops. The wind dies. The silvery light turns an eerie, bruised purple.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a3fdd2c1-a578-46c1-b790-c0ae41e64440">
      <Text>BAILEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="88477c13-5d26-4c86-86fb-743d4c558ce1">
      <Text>(to Emmett)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="49ff1108-4dc6-4e01-8c21-2c0fbb7572b5">
      <Text>Check this out, loser. Special eclipse trick.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="89f78ffd-6686-4b74-ad6d-d51425204576">
      <Text>Bailey pulls out a high-intensity laser pointer. He aims it directly at Emmett’s face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="585f70c8-f2d9-4343-ae54-2aa02f8bc112">
      <Text>YORO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="34fdee0a-a419-451b-abe7-d03578910ab9">
      <Text>Bailey, stop! You’ll burn his retinas!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="611c1f7b-77b7-4222-b689-249a541ca7cd">
      <Text>MINH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="614d485c-4162-4564-81e4-af7d6930f181">
      <Text>(Lunging)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="67d7fade-61cd-4465-8b83-50aaa97a3c7b">
      <Text>Hey! That’s a three-thousand dollar telescope—don't you dare!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2ab78aa0-02f3-4e8b-9daf-0ad51063c42c">
      <Text>Bailey laughs, swiping the beam across Emmett’s eyes. Emmett yelps, clutching his face and breaking his "monk" vow with a high-pitched scream.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c7d7ee4f-3e52-4320-a674-646091659f17">
      <Text>Before </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sall</Text>
      <Text> or Minh can intervene, a blur of denim and braids streaks across the grass.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="069ad032-87a3-4070-9b89-1cd82d257edf">
      <Text>Savanna</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="82a75683-b2a6-4d9d-9d86-e7f0e9953130">
      <Text>(as Baker G)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="20681680-99cc-49dd-964a-d245b21def38">
      <Text>Extinction event!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8e61d483-2f3d-474d-88e9-d4d69d66ba4c">
      <Text>Savanna tackles Bailey mid-laugh. They hit the dirt hard. She executes a headlock she clearly learned from late-night TV.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f6792e75-b43c-4ea5-b137-4d96b354afc4">
      <Text>FANNY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9b5e2320-d595-4456-960c-e03b5077c2f6">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sall</Text>
      <Text>, get your wild animal off my Bailey!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e3083495-9df6-42e6-8ad1-a0f8c4755a61">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">SALL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="c3683f67-3b59-432a-b302-0245a6b006db">
      <Text>(Grabbing Savanna)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="28dc79a0-3e62-4d8f-bedc-9257080f7815">
      <Text>Savanna, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">lâche</Text>
      <Text>-le! Enough!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="92fe750d-5110-4a1b-b78a-e2b483e8a915">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sall</Text>
      <Text> pulls her back, but she manages to kick Bailey’s expensive sunglasses into the weeds.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0a8a63c4-6093-475f-b94a-493779e74f76">
      <Text>TOTALITY HITS.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="55471912-870f-4260-b74e-f6997d8347a5">
      <Text>The world goes black. A shimmering white ring—the Corona—burns in the sky. It is silent, terrifying, and beautiful.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7d233e51-42cd-472c-b719-a83eda37a7dc">
      <Text>DAWN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="5e6bfc86-957f-42d8-8d06-85cbc8ed8a62">
      <Text>(Whispering)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="35d1fc8b-9e75-42f1-8e00-86a21c3b1597">
      <Text>It looks like the eye of a dead god.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6ef95894-4083-4790-8fe1-66e047714f4c">
      <Text>YORO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="1545f6be-e366-4996-a5df-7a96b6dfca24">
      <Text>(Staring up)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4cac7dbd-4595-44dc-8045-76e5008edda4">
      <Text>It’s perfect.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="46930ff6-737b-47f5-9fc6-b177f0b2ae82">
      <Text>While the adults are shouting and Bailey is whimpering, a tiny spark of gold zips out of the brush. It isn't headed for the sun; it’s headed for the chaos.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dc358813-c26e-4524-bb1e-1f5793ff9e10">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">fifollet</Text>
      <Text>—NAOMI—dives into the middle of the group. She zips around Savanna’s head, then Dawn’s.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6629465c-8155-453d-86bd-dee91d15d024">
      <Text>DAWN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="286393db-d2fb-47f4-8818-a8ce8d88f767">
      <Text>Yoro! The match!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a379b21c-215f-451c-8471-c56838400619">
      <Text>Dawn doesn't wait. She lunges. She doesn't use a net; she uses her oversized emo beanie. With a violent SWISH, she traps the glow against her chest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="11e47cc8-3a35-4c46-9bd2-a859d9978532">
      <Text>YORO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0850771c-c410-49be-a408-c5442c5e6ea1">
      <Text>You got it? Dawn, did you get it?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f83cb65a-9276-4057-b3d2-16141c33efd4">
      <Text>DAWN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e1913e0e-d342-44a1-b624-fdfb88a8d1ce">
      <Text>My heart’s beating...?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="530a61ef-62ae-42db-a29d-6ebcbee8200c">
      <Text>The sun begins to peek back out—the "Diamond Ring" effect. The light returns instantly, harsh and revealing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f5f65e6e-34ce-424a-9448-ab50bb84ce85">
      <Text>Fanny is standing over them, her face contorted in rage.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6a564053-5932-4090-b4b6-96866c1830e9">
      <Text>FANNY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="837005e9-a4c8-4d02-822c-76d09a039f82">
      <Text>That’s it. All of you. Off my land. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sall</Text>
      <Text>, Minh—I want the back rent by Monday or I’m calling the sheriff to clear that duplex out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d8b74555-40f4-4b3f-821a-455285c2decf">
      <Text>MINH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b768dad2-a7ed-4ae4-8f0d-57642c746294">
      <Text>Fanny, come on, the boy was blinded—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="846d2e6a-ad29-47c6-b9ee-58b6e476e467">
      <Text>FANNY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="68eba125-a1ee-4b61-906d-ecdb309a3e5d">
      <Text>(Pointing to the exit)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e211d700-0bf8-49e2-83e9-6e48efe41b1e">
      <Text>OUT!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="bc189101-b6a2-484b-8c5e-363ae7f1f245">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="11" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DAWN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SALL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SAVANNA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="YORO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. SAKHO-CHU DUPLEX - LATER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c2bf0139-72ca-43c8-82b7-c6038322bc53">
      <Text>The mood is somber. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sall</Text>
      <Text> and Minh are on the porch, speaking in hushed, stressed tones about money.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a61dc00c-4f5e-4643-83fd-4b0f1e691322">
      <Text>In the backyard, the four kids huddle around a glass pickle jar.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="01f11068-b302-4137-97b9-45de2a16a619">
      <Text>Inside the jar, a single firefly pulses with an impossibly bright, neon-gold light. Beside it, the BAKER G action figure sits propped against the glass.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a331c03c-5003-49ca-99cb-622ade40d0e9">
      <Text>SAVANNA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ef180a7a-e970-4c10-9090-6e12a8a0e74a">
      <Text>She’s beautiful. I’m naming her Naomi. After the Glow Queen.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5135387c-3329-435d-af99-093d06aa794b">
      <Text>YORO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="ec9f11ea-dc93-47a9-b8f5-ac4b075c4b17">
      <Text>(Adjusting his glasses)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7e77597e-6585-4d19-bf0d-e6a10bee8562">
      <Text>It’s just a </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Photuris</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">lucicrescens</Text>
      <Text>. A firefly. The eclipse probably messed with its bioluminescence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ad089aab-4ffb-43e7-aec7-1d295d81247b">
      <Text>DAWN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fbde3df8-7920-487b-b10b-40faab621541">
      <Text>It’s not a bug, Yoro. Look at how she’s looking at the doll.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c2f9ad81-c24a-484c-b179-74b93b368324">
      <Text>Inside the jar, Naomi lands on Baker G’s plastic shoulder. The light from her tail begins to bleed into the plastic. The action figure’s tiny painted eyes seem to... flicker.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="59d91cc9-aa1f-4173-a63e-cc29c072251a">
      <Text>Suddenly, the wind picks up. Not a breeze—a HOWL. The palm trees across the street bend nearly double.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b26de40b-951e-4ebf-a79a-209eb6d1ab86">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">SALL</Text>
      <Text> (O.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7b19cbc1-c0fc-4780-95ad-cee6e74fadd1">
      <Text>Kids! Inside! The radio says the cell just turned into a hurricane!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="328d2ae4-a032-4bb2-bb88-efb3f989daac">
      <Text>SAVANNA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="a219cd38-6e26-4a6f-97bf-d83c49cc7489">
      <Text>(Grabbing the jar)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="24f215b1-ec2c-4055-9c41-3641f756784d">
      <Text>Come on, Naomi.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="57589db7-707f-4d89-865d-61cc6154f67f">
      <Text>As they run for the door, the jar glows so bright it turns Savanna’s hand transparent, revealing her bones like an X-ray.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="f8c834cf-b663-4f19-9cde-111bcd77f487">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="12" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MINH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SALL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SAVANNA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Sakho Living Room - Moments Later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bc57b3fb-96c9-4e5e-be7d-0c4d547614fc">
      <Text>The house </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">groans</Text>
      <Text>. Rain lashes against the siding like handfuls of gravel. Inside, the air is thick and smells of ozone and old chimney soot.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1e05bf69-e7b2-4f43-a501-fe5dec341a46">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sall</Text>
      <Text> paces, checking his phone. No bars.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="21dd781a-ce0c-47a0-989a-2ab917a06012">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">SALL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c0b14903-36ae-4d0f-b097-639512460f47">
      <Text>The grid is down. Minh! You got the shutters on the south side?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="74e15256-a60d-4096-9107-eb07ee8b5d86">
      <Text>MINH (O.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="b367c19f-0fdc-46a8-8edf-ea20db2a40ac">
      <Text>(Through the wall)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f8ef26cd-ca72-4eba-8761-e54f4dd27842">
      <Text>The wind is pushing back, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sall</Text>
      <Text>! It’s like the house is fighting me!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e122c3e0-1869-4dcb-a254-4b32d3ed2c44">
      <Text>The power suddenly goes out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2e864356-2685-4c63-aeba-938f59b4bca2">
      <Text>Savanna sits on the rug, the pickle jar between her knees.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fe21710d-4b14-4e68-a76e-a0386df8550e">
      <Text>SAVANNA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="62f64b99-5fc6-42c4-8f2c-fb41411a7ec5">
      <Text>(as Baker G)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f318c1c6-0717-4006-b392-985e7f4e4679">
      <Text>Baker G with an important announcement: bedtime!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ed1ab01b-6adf-4241-9f72-562686dc4a8e">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sall</Text>
      <Text> and Minh look at each other, amused.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="229beea5-1801-4d09-990b-84792a52dc34">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="12" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BAKER G">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SAVANNA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Savanna’s Bedroom - Night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8718e4a2-dee8-48ee-8ee8-8a53a9726c25">
      <Text>Naomi brings Baker G to life.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5f69ac2b-c876-4871-9439-b9b0afb9387c">
      <Text>Baker G wakes up Savanna. Baker G sounds like a woman.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ce0b11a0-5548-4e3e-8bb6-709345456838">
      <Text>SavaNNA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="35f9d9f1-4f4f-485a-93bc-c80249e6b67c">
      <Text>What did I eat?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0d2a1054-c947-4266-9789-65daedff669e">
      <Text>BakER G</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1bf9bae9-b141-4718-b921-fb57f83f8880">
      <Text>You ate your vitamins.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="22e9dd4f-076b-4bb6-902f-d3527b3d1190">
      <Text>SAVANNA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="54858142-0130-4e79-8cd8-10b58a9519c8">
      <Text>This has gotta be a dream...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="188bf128-66f8-4112-9ab3-93b9a6367f9f">
      <Text>Baker G</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e6d9836d-b5fa-4990-9f75-8a42b554e05f">
      <Text>Dreams are for sleepers!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="059ca920-2f50-44e9-8400-49f01c600514">
      <Text>SaVANNA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="462c0678-cb4a-4399-ac9f-c53439042d50">
      <Text>Sleepers?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f02295a3-8753-4f87-802c-de47ba62b83a">
      <Text>BakER G</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d51f2922-b04c-413c-add1-5ad02275b679">
      <Text>Reality is for followers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e7defbea-82ab-4445-847c-f29d03fc8840">
      <Text>Baker G goes to the doorway. They open the outside screen door, revealing the pouring rain.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="39f3e9a1-7f45-4938-9907-97567f8fd990">
      <Text>Baker G</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7afef3de-93c9-47a5-9ff6-b9d10eaec16d">
      <Text>We </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gotta</Text>
      <Text> match to catch!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="97362968-07c9-47d7-b793-ddec2caafc33">
      <Text>SaVANNA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="47859142-3e64-4e2e-b3aa-fe7afe311372">
      <Text>I ain’t catching a cold...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a4af0715-20c7-4a65-bb27-3447c88edcb2">
      <Text>Baker G grabs a match from a nearby matchbox. They light up the fireplace.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="849f4185-5cba-4f67-9c8c-e55ce18803a6">
      <Text>SaVANNA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6ee1ddf6-c682-4eb7-adde-fbef9a92faa0">
      <Text>A match to catch... I see.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6706d9fe-aac7-40ac-b1e0-23d26cff7571">
      <Text>The fireplace turns into a doorway.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="807f410a-93b5-4fa9-80c2-416b1dd5fb5f">
      <Text>BakER G</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b4bc5a89-8bd7-4470-8138-76a0fc216513">
      <Text>Come with me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="84e625d2-030c-4495-bc2a-85d88fab2bab">
      <Text>Savanna follows Baker G into the doorway.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5b8a6a29-887e-452a-9c4d-9ba3e84101e7">
      <Text>A CRACK of lightning hits the backyard. The house shakes. The lights flicker and DIE.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

