        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">616 818 5413</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Center" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline">Series</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">After their fathers vanish in a hurricane, the neighboring Senegalese American and Vietnamese American siblings must protect their Louisiana duplex from a magic-hungry French American landowner by using a captured will-o’-the-wisp to summon ancestors, who grow troubled by the kids' immature requests.</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Center" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Center" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Center" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline">Episode</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Alignment="Full" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.00" OutlineLevel="1" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">After capturing a supernatural spirit during a solar eclipse, two immigrant families in a Louisiana duplex must survive a hurricane and an ancient land-grabbing conspiracy when their fathers vanish, leaving the kids to defend their home alongside a foul-mouthed wrestling figure and a summoned 18th-century ancestor.</Text>
      </Paragraph>
    </Content>
    <TextState Scaling="100" Selection="0,0" ShowInvisibles="No"/>
  </TitlePage>

